1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:02,920
Stop calling yourself elite...

2
00:00:02,947 --> 00:00:04,930
if you can't read this.

3
00:00:05,354 --> 00:00:06,660
This is the Zero Cut.

4
00:00:07,020 --> 00:00:09,300
It starts by selling the handoff.

5
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:11,020
Watch the defender.

6
00:00:11,540 --> 00:00:14,260
His weight is already on the wrong leg.

7
00:00:15,340 --> 00:00:17,120
The guard changes direction...

8
00:00:17,473 --> 00:00:19,100
slips behind him...

9
00:00:19,220 --> 00:00:20,760
and the lane opens.

10
00:00:21,140 --> 00:00:23,150
No handoff. One pass.

11
00:00:23,360 --> 00:00:24,710
Easy finish.

12
00:00:26,180 --> 00:00:28,450
But if the help defender steps across...

13
00:00:28,890 --> 00:00:30,190
don't force it.

14
00:00:30,482 --> 00:00:33,010
That rotation leaves the corner open.

15
00:00:34,320 --> 00:00:35,210
One cut.

16
00:00:36,020 --> 00:00:37,130
Two reads.

17
00:00:38,040 --> 00:00:40,340
Elite players don't just run plays.

18
00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:42,490
They read the defense.

19
00:00:43,218 --> 00:00:48,440
The future elite will think faster... read faster... and punish every mistake.

20
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:52,490
Follow E2A... and be part of the elite of the future.

